# Operator / VPN egress addresses allowed to reach the MinIO and RabbitMQ
# consoles (deploy/haproxy/dev01.cfg `acl ops_ip`).
#
# Copy to /etc/haproxy/ops-ips.lst on the host and fill it in. An EMPTY list
# matches nothing, so the deny rules in dev01.cfg reject every console request
# until real addresses are added — deny-by-default is the intended state.
#
# One address or CIDR per line, e.g.:
#   203.0.113.10
#   198.51.100.0/24
#
# Do NOT commit real addresses to this repository.
